     "Gelanesaurus cochranae, also known commonly as Cochran's neusticurus, is a species of lizard in the family Gymnophthalmidae. The species is native to northwestern South America."
    ]
   },
   {
    "h": "Etymology",
    "level": 2,
    "paras": [
